mage\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35f4b92a-6b21-44fb-b3bf-270b8f673f99\" />\r\n\r\nThe same texture in RGB8 for comparison:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1397\" height=\"712\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c6b8a98-4259-466a-975f-420b3dfdd6b6\" />\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110257#pullrequestreview-3203796581","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110257","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-09-09T23:51:42Z"}]